          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dhɔr Ɣil-ki-yaa cua Ɣä-cɛ̈b-yaa, dhɔr Yɛ-dɛ̈-yaa cua Nɛ-tan-el.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ciööt bööthni palä kɛnɛ ji̱ Lii-bay tëë ca gɔ̱r",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ciööt bööthni dho̱ri bööthni palä kɛnɛ ji̱ Lii-bay tëë ca gɔ̱r nikɛ ni̱n bööthni palä ni Ɛl-ya-cib kɛnɛ Yo-ya-da kɛ Yo-ɣa-nan kɛ Ya-duwa cu mäni ruec Dɔr-ya-wɛc kuäär Pa-rath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cua ciööt bööthni dho̱ri kuayni ji̱ Lii-bay gɔ̱a̱r rɛy buɔk kuɛ̈ɛ̈ni amäni ni̱n Yo-ɣa-nan gat Ɛl-ya-cib.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tho̱p lätni rɛy luaak Kuɔth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu bööth ji̱ Lii-bay a, Ɣä-cɛ̈b-yaa kɛnɛ Ce-reb-yaa kɛ Yɛ-cuwä gat Kɛ̈d-mi-el, kɛ gaatmani tin cuŋ lotädiɛn a ga̱a̱mkɛ rɔ̱ kɛ diit tɛthkä lɔaac, ce̱tnikɛ mëë ca lat ɛ raan Kuɔth ni Dee-bid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Mɛ̈-tɛ̈n-yaa kɛnɛ Bak-bu-ki-yaa kɛ O-bad-yaa kɛ Mɛ-cu-lam kɛ Tɛ̈l-mon kɛnɛ Ɛ̈-kub a ga̱a̱ŋ thuɔk kal, guɛckɛ thuk duëli tɔ̱ɔ̱wä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cua kɛn nɛy tëë lät kɛ ni̱n Yo-ya-kim gat Yɛ-cuwä gatdöö Yo-dha-dak, kɛnɛ Nɛ-ɣɛm-yaa min la rueec kɛ Ɛdhra min la bo̱o̱th palä kä gɔ̱ɔ̱r.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lëy Nɛ-ɣɛm-yaa kɛ päny Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë lɛ̈ykɛ päny Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, cua ji̱ Lii-bay go̱r gua̱thni diaal tin tekɛ thi̱n kɛ ɣöö bakɛ nööŋ kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm ba ti̱em leyä ben la̱t kɛ tɛ̈th lɔaac kɛ diit puɔnyni tɛthkä lɔaac kɛnɛ puɔ̱t buɔ̱li kɛnɛ thuɔmni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cua këët din nööŋ kɛɛl bä rɛy cieŋ in thieek kɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛnɛ wi̱i̱ Nɛ-to-paa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ Beth-gil-gal kɛnɛ rɛy ciëŋ Gabä kɛ Ɛ̈dh-ma-wɛth, kɛ ɣöö kɛn këët din ca rɔ̱ lät kä wi̱i̱ thieekä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci bööth palä kɛ ji̱ Lii-bay rɔ̱ lak, cukɛ naath lak, kä cukɛ thiekni wec kɛnɛ päny lak bä.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua̱ ruëëc Juda jak kä ko̱t wi̱i̱ pa̱a̱ny. Kä cua̱ bua̱a̱n da̱ŋ rɛw ti di̱t kuany ti ba diit tɛthkä lɔaac kɛt. Cu buɔ̱n kɛl wä kɛ kui̱c cuëëc kɛ wi̱c pa̱a̱ny wäkɛ Thok Wäär. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua kɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱rɛ Ɣo-ca-yaa kɛnɛ tha̱a̱ŋ bööthni ji̱ Juda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛɛl kɛ Ä-dhar-yaa kɛnɛ Ɛdhra kɛ Mɛ-cu-lam, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ Juda kɛnɛ Ben-ya-min kɛ Cɛ-mɛ̈-yaa kɛnɛ Yir-mɛ-yaa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ tha̱a̱ŋ bööthni palä kɛ kaaŋni, kɛ Dhɛ-kar-yaa gat Jo-na-than gat Cɛ-mɛ̈-yaa gat Mɛ̈-tɛ̈n-yaa gat Mi-ka-yaa gat Dha-kur gat A-thap, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ ji̱ maarädɛ ni Cɛ-mɛ̈-yaa kɛnɛ Ä-dhar-el kɛ Mi-la-lay kɛnɛ Gi-la-lay kɛ Maac kɛnɛ Nɛ-tan-el kɛ Juda kɛnɛ Ɣä-na-ni, kɛ thuɔmni ti ce̱tkɛ nyin Dee-bid raan Kuɔth. Kä cua kɛ bo̱th ɛ gɔ̱ɔ̱r ni Ɛdhra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ wä kɛ Thok Pirä pi̱i̱ni, wäkɛ a luɔtkɛ ni nhiamdiɛn kɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱p in wä wi̱c Dee-bid, cukɛ loc wi̱i̱ pa̱a̱ny wäkɛ kɛ wi̱c duëël Dee-bid wäkɛ Thok Pi̱i̱ni kui̱ känyä ca̱ŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu buɔ̱n in rɛwdɛ wä kɛ kui̱c caam. Kä cua̱ kɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r kɛ tha̱a̱ŋ nath kɛ wi̱c pa̱a̱ny, wä nɛy kɛ wi̱c Bi̱lɛkä Buɔ̱l jurayni, wä nɛy Pääny in Taar, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cuakɔ wä kɛ Thok Ɛ-pa-rim kɛnɛ Thok ëë wal kɛ Thok Rɛc kɛnɛ Biɛɛ Ɣä-nan-el kɛ Biɛɛ Kuri a wä ni Thok Deet, cukɛ wä cuɔ̱ŋ ni Thok Ga̱a̱ŋni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu kɛn bua̱a̱n da̱ŋ rɛw tin kɛ̈tkɛ diit puɔnyä tɛthä lɔaac wä cuɔ̱ŋ ni rɛy luaak Kuɔth, cu mäni ɣän kɔnɛ tha̱a̱ŋ ruëëcni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amäni bööth palä, ni Ɛl-ya-kim kɛnɛ Mä-the-yaa kɛ Min-ya-min kɛnɛ Mi-ka-yaa kɛ Ɛl-yo-ɛ-nay kɛnɛ Dhɛ-kar-yaa kɛ Ɣä-nɛ̈n-yaa kɛ kaaŋnikiɛn, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cu mäni Mä-the-yaa kɛnɛ Cɛ-mɛ̈-yaa kɛ Ɛl-a-dhar kɛnɛ Udhi kɛ Yɛ-ɣo-ɣa-nan kɛnɛ Mɛ̈l-ki-yaa kɛ Ee-lam kɛ E-dhɛr. Kä cu këët din ki̱et kɛɛl kɛ bo̱o̱thdiɛn ni Yidh-ra̱-yaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ muc ti ŋuan thöp ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ, cu lo̱ckiɛn tɛɛth kɛ ɣöö ci Kuoth kɛ moc kɛ tɛ̈th lɔaac mi di̱i̱t. Cu män kɛnɛ gaat lo̱ckiɛn tɛɛth bä. Cua jɔw tɛthä lɔaac nath kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm liŋ ni guäth mi na̱n.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.43",
