    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tin ŋuɔ̱nkɛ kɛ kui̱ palä rɛy luaak Kuɔth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn guäth ɛmɔ cua naath kuany ti bia̱ gueec duëël kuakni tin ba thol, dɛy jiɛn tin nhiam kɛnɛ wa̱l wa̱a̱li. Kɛn nɛy tɔ̱tɔ̱ kɛ ti̱eet kɛ tin ba thol rɛy ka̱a̱kni wi̱i̱ni, tin ca thiec kɛ kui̱ bööthni palä kɛnɛ ji̱ Lii-bay ce̱tnikɛ min ca lar ɛ ŋuɔ̱t. Cu ji̱ Juda lo̱ckiɛn tɛɛth kɛ bööth palä tin lät kɛnɛ ji̱ Lii-bay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ lät Kuɔthdiɛn la̱t, kä cukɛ lät la̱k nath la̱t, ce̱tkɛ min ca la̱t ɛ këët din kɛnɛ ga̱a̱ŋ thuɔk kal ce̱tnikɛ mëë ca lar ɛ Dee-bid kɛnɛ gatdɛ ni Thɔ-lo-mon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni wal, kɛ ni̱n Dee-bid kɛnɛ A-thap, la te bo̱o̱th thi̱n kä këët din mi bo̱o̱th diit tɛthä lɔaac kɛnɛ diit puɔnyä Kuɔth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ ni̱n Dhɛ-ru-ba-bɛl kɛnɛ Nɛ-ɣɛm-yaa, la ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal këët din kɛnɛ ga̱a̱ŋ thuɔk kal a käm kui̱diɛn ni ciaŋ. Kä la kɛn kui̱ ji̱ Lii-bay a läth go̱lä, kä bi ji̱ Lii-bay kui̱ gan Ä-ron lɛ la̱th go̱lä.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
